Based on inspiration from the Tiniest OS in the world</comment><comment id="mSTOM,P{=GV3DSw3{s3:" x="-1024" y="-119" w="169" h="100">Button A (Apps Toggle)</comment><comment id="1{~Qg2upyRzBVw8x_9XF" x="829" y="441" w="169" h="100">Button B
Apps Toggle</comment><comment id="3Q*~h^1SZ~Cg-g?JKBY-" x="380" y="-549" w="159" h="100">Shake Logic</comment><comment id="pHIZVsx3|/Ys0:eSSQJ|" x="-744" y="-537" w="601" h="418">Notes:
The Blueberry OS will contain 6 apps:
# Mail
# Game
# Mood Swinger
# Duck Hop
# Dice
# Alarm
Press 1 To Select
HOW TO USE MAIL:
PRESS B TO LAUNCH THE APP WHEN ON THE SCREEN.
PRESS P1 TO TOGGLE THE RADIO GROUP
PRESS P0 TO SELECT THE RADIO GROUP
PRESS P2 TO TOGGLE THE MESSAGE
PRESS P0 AGAIN TO SEND THE MESSAGE TO ANOTHER DEVICE ON THE SAME GROUP.
</comment><comment id="#`eBe@0sp78=Y4ZE$9jW" x="-1494" y="-86" w="169" h="100">Select Apps Pin
